t as for those who turn aside to their crooked ways,","poem":1},{"text":"Adonai will lead them away with the workers of vain striving of iniquity.","poem":2},{"text":"Peace be on Israel [God prevails].","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/eng_our/PSA/125.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/eng_our/PSA/126.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/eng_our/PSA/124.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":5}